<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Seaford, N.Y., school bond issue.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Seaford, N.Y., school bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance Seaford Union Free School District, N.Y.'s $5 million school bond issue.</p>
<p>The deal is set for competitive pricing at 1100 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
